# Optional. The LLM sense helper is the last vote for APPLY vs ABSTAIN on a
# surviving candidate (decide/llm_helper.py) — it never finds names and
# never writes SQLite. Leave KIVI_LLM_API_KEY empty to run ungated: every
# cheap door still applies (no_memory, conflicting_canonicals, low_confidence,
# already_canonical), but a surviving candidate APPLYs without a sense check.
# That means a homograph like Groww/grow or kiwi/Kivi WILL rewrite in every
# sentence without a key. See README "LLM sense helper" and RUN.md.
#
# Default provider is Anthropic Claude Haiku — paid, but meaningfully more
# accurate on sense-disambiguation than the free models we measured (Groq,
# OpenRouter): see RUN.md for the comparison. Any OpenAI-compatible chat
# completions host works — nothing provider-specific in the code. A free
# alternative, e.g. Groq:
#   KIVI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
#   KIVI_LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b

KIVI_LLM_API_KEY=
KIVI_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com/v1
KIVI_LLM_MODEL=claude-haiku-4-5-20251001
